  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop combines Korean BBQ-style proteins with rice, noodles, vegetables, and its signature sauces, so the nutrition of a bowl depends on more than the protein you choose.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Cupbop Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to compare Bops, sauces, sides, and snacks, or combine several items to see the calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, and sodium in your complete order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.olgtlksbuc3a\">\n<span>\n     What Makes Up a Cupbop Bowl?\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop bowls bring several components together in one cup.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Rather than thinking of the meal as chicken, beef, or pork alone, it is more useful to look at the complete combination of:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Rice and noodles\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Vegetables\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Protein\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sauce\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Those components explain why Cupbop bowls can contain a significant amount of carbohydrates even when the main topping is meat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, current NutritionSolver data lists the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Kko Kko Bop at about 593 calories with 26.3g protein and 93.9g carbohydrates\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , while the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Piggy Bop contains about 693 calories with 28g protein and 102.2g carbohydrates\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The full bowl matters, not just the meat on top.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.esj1ot5aue0i\">\n<span>\n     Each Bop Has Its Own Nutrition Profile\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop's named bowls should be treated as separate meals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current options in the NutritionSolver database include:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Kko Kko Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     B Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Piggy Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Rock Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Krunch Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Ugly Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Snow Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Doochi Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Veggie Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Noodle Bop\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The calorie range between them can be substantial.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, the current database lists:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<div><div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 glass-card-static\"><table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Cupbop Item\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Calories\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Protein\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Veggie Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         499\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         7.3g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Doochi Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         532\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         31.6g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Krunch Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         557\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         31.3g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Kko Kko Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         593\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         26.3g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         B Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         643\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         28g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Piggy Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         693\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         28g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Ugly Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         884\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         26.8g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Snow Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         1,025\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         26.9g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Rock Bop\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         1,293\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         27.7g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table></div></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is why choosing a bowl based only on its protein name can be misleading. The other ingredients in the recipe can make a large difference to the final calorie and macro totals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.g77849ib3sfh\">\n<span>\n     Sauce Level Can Change More Than the Heat\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop uses numbered sauces, and the sauce should be counted as part of the meal rather than treated as a calorie-free seasoning.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver currently contains separate nutrition entries for sauces from\n    </span>\n<span>\n     #1 through #10\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , plus additional sauce options.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Those entries vary considerably in calories, carbohydrates, sugar, fat, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, the current database shows some lower-numbered sauces contributing more than 200 calories per listed serving, while the #10 Sauce is much lower in calories but still contributes carbohydrates and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     So when you choose your preferred sauce level, make sure the nutrition entry matches the sauce used on your bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.g0eozu4yms1t\">\n<span>\n     Protein Is Only One Part of a High-Protein Bowl\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Several Cupbop bowls provide more than 20g of protein, but a higher-protein bowl can still contain substantial calories, carbohydrates, fat, or sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Krunch Bop\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , for example, currently provides about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     31.3g of protein for 557 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , while the Rock Bop provides a similar amount of protein at a much higher overall calorie total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That makes protein-to-calorie comparison useful when deciding between bowls.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Instead of asking only which Cupbop item contains the most protein, compare:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Protein\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Total calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carbohydrates\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Fat\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sodium\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     together.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.m99wypqv4317\">\n<span>\n     Sodium Can Add Up Quickly\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop is also a menu where sodium deserves attention separately from calories.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current NutritionSolver values include approximately:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Kko Kko Bop: 1,288mg sodium\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Piggy Bop: 1,260mg\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Mando Bop: 1,328mg\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Snow Bop: 1,400mg\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sauces can add more sodium on top of the base meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Kimchi also contains relatively little energy but can contribute a meaningful amount of sodium. The current database lists the serving at about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     30 calories and 690mg sodium\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is a good example of why the lowest-calorie item is not automatically the lowest-sodium item.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.81fprmvsc80x\">\n<span>\n     K-Dawgs and Mandoo Are Separate From the Bowl\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop also offers Korean-style sides and snacks.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current NutritionSolver entries include\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Mandoo\n    </span>\n<span>\n     and several\n    </span>\n<span>\n     K-Dawg\n    </span>\n<span>\n     preparations.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A 3-piece Mandoo serving is currently listed at about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     99 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , while K-Dawg varieties are around\n    </span>\n<span>\n     650 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     each in the existing database.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order one alongside a Bop, add it separately.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Kko Kko Bop + Mandoo\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Kko Kko Bop + K-Dawg\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     have very different totals even though the main bowl is identical.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ucxn1fd4tdsh\">\n<span>\n     Calculate the Complete Cupbop Order\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For the most realistic result, include everything you plan to eat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A complete order may look like:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bop + selected sauce + kimchi\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     or\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bop + Mandoo + drink\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     or\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bop + K-Dawg + drink\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The NutritionSolver meal builder lets you combine these items rather than calculating each nutrient manually.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.cy4ta9whcwmh\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Cupbop bowl?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Which Cupbop bowls have the most protein?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Cupbop sauce add calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Cupbop Mandoo?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is Veggie Bop low in protein?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Why can Cupbop nutrition vary?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.6z3ef9oyl4rp\">\n<span>\n     Understand Your Whole Cupbop Bowl\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cupbop nutrition makes the most sense when you look at the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     entire bowl rather than one ingredient\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Choose the exact Bop first, then account for the sauce, Mandoo, kimchi, K-Dawg, drink, or other extras you actually order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That gives you a clearer picture of the calories, protein, carbs, fat, and sodium in your complete Cupbop meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "Cupbop Nutrition Calculator: Calories, Protein & Macros",
  "seoDescription": "Check Cupbop calories, protein, carbs, fat, and sodium for Korean BBQ bowls, chicken, beef, pork, tofu, sauces, Mandoo, K-Dawgs, kimchi, and more."
